            "review_text": "Damon Rogde\nLos Angeles, California5 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Vietnamese Home-Cooked Taste\nApr 2025 • Friends\nThis restaurant gave me a real taste of Vietnamese home cooking. I tried several dishes like caramelized pork, stir-fried vegetables, and a delicious sour soup. Everything was fresh, flavorful, and felt like a meal cooked with love.\n\nThe atmosphere was cozy and relaxed, and the staff were very friendly and helpful. It felt like being invited to a Vietnamese family dinner. Highly recommended if you want to try real, everyday Vietnamese food.\nRead more\nWritten April 18, 2025",
