            "review_text": "Kiều L\n6 contributions\n0\nRestaurant in Đong Hoi city\nMar 2025 • Family\nheart of Dong Hoi city, I had the pleasure of dining here with my family and it was a wonderful experience. We truly enjoyed the delicious and unique Vietnamese dishes they served. The restaurant is clean, spacious, and conveniently located in the city center. They also provide kid chairs and kid-friendly meals, which made it perfect for families. The staff spoke English very well and gave us helpful travel tips for our trip. A great place to experience authentic Vietnamese cuisine with your loved ones!\nRead more\nWritten April 16, 2025",
